<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>
        <%= targetUser.username %> | PrismLens
    </title>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/index.css" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/profile.css" />
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

        <div class="page-content">
            <div class="profile-head">
                <div class="profile-picture-container"></div>

                <div class="profile-badge">
                    <div class="profile-username">
                        <%= targetUser.username %>
                    </div>
                    <div class="profile-age">
                        <%= targetUser.dateCreated %>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="profile-actions">
                    <a class="button" href="/account/<%=targetUser.id%>/settings">Settings</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="profile-body">
                <div class="profile-biography">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nam porttitor
                    volutpat auctor. Proin ullamcorper augue suscipit, placerat velit ut, elementum urna. Nam id felis
                    id mi congue congue at id lacus. Sed nec ultricies eros. Integer eu dignissim nibh. Nam scelerisque
                    neque sed faucibus interdum. Donec luctus tellus in faucibus volutpat. Nam a tellus at velit
                    condimentum maximus. </div>
            </div>
        </div>
</body>

</html>